===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A place where [[public]] [[transport]] [[bus]]es stop to allow [[passenger]]s to [[board]] or [[leave]].
#* '''2011''', {{w|Rebecca Black}} featuring [[w:Patrice Wilson|Patrice Wilson]], ''[[w:Friday (Rebecca Black song)|Friday]]''
#*: Gotta get down to the '''bus stop'''
#*: Gotta catch my bus, I see my friends
# A [[disco]] [[dance]] popular in the 1970s and 1980s.

